    <DisplayName>Saguaro Hours: Time Tracking and Timesheets</DisplayName>
    <Description xml:space="preserve">Log time on work items, fill a weekly timesheet, approve weeks and export reports. Your time data stays in your Azure DevOps organization. Free for up to 5 people.</Description>
